                </p>

                <p class="mb-0">
                    Understanding Delegates and Events is important for developing
                    flexible and maintainable <strong>.NET and ASP.NET Core</strong>
                    applications.
                </p>

            </div>


            <!-- PRACTICE QUESTIONS -->
            <div class="card shadow-sm p-4 p-md-5 mb-4">

                <h2 class="h2 fw-bold text-dark mt-1 mb-4">
